caption:
VERY happy with me driving yesterday. Even though it’s a disadvantage chasing first - I have the most fun when I treat every battle like it’s finals. I was pushing HARD on my chase with @conorshanahan79 and did a poor job at tire conservation… tried to do a gangster flick into the last corner and didn’t realize I had no tire left. Very upset at myself for not dialing it back a bit - but stoked at the same time that I can leave the event proud of driving exactly how I wanted. Hope I made yall proud despite getting knocked out in 16 🫡

