Yesterday meant more than I can express in a few words. While filming our documentary I visited Prampram, the birthplace of my grandfather, Joseph Cecil Ofuatey-Kodjoe. Hosted and accompanied by Chief Nene Annorbitettey Mansro, I was welcomed by my local extended family and presented with an honorary Chieftaincy by the Paramount Chief of Prampram, Nene Tetteh Wakah, a moment I will never forget.

Thank you to my nephew Curtis Nana Kofi Egyir and Anguah Anorkor Abbey for coordinating so graciously. The power of ancestry reaches beyond generations and across oceans. 

@abinoshotit
@smpsignedmedia

