“I did not have balance in my career. I was to the complete  extreme.“

Our 3rd episode dropped today! Go have a listen. We discuss “work-life balance” is it a realistic goal or a fictional ideal? 

We break down the illusion of the 50/50 split and unpack what it really takes to perform at the highest levels of sport, media, and parenthood. 

@jennytaft 
@whateverittakes_pod

We came. We cried. We hugged. I was honored to be asked to join the OGs at the site of the now infamous “Clip Clip” gangster lunch.  I even repeated the same safari outfit.  I hadn’t met all of the women but as I said in my toast there is an unspoken sisterhood among those of us who’ve been part of this iconic franchise. Perspective changes everything.

(Note: I have no idea what I was praying for…. Maybe that they’d all get to the lunch on time. They didn’t. 😂)
🍎♥️

